# New feature module

Add experiments as `lib/<name>/`, following `news` (full stack) or `traffic_light` (UI + in-memory domain).

## Layout

```
lib/<name>/
  data/repo/<name>_repository.dart       # when something is loaded or stored
  domain/models/
  domain/usecases/<action>_uc.dart       # @Injectable, call()
  view/bloc/<name>_bloc.dart             # @Injectable, freezed event + state
  view/model/
  view/page/<name>_page.dart
  view/widgets/
```

- Pages end in `_page.dart`. Screen content that is not the route widget ends in `_content.dart`.
- Bloc file owns `part` files: `<name>_event.dart`, `<name>_state.dart`, `<name>_bloc.freezed.dart`.

## Wiring

1. Annotate new blocs, use cases, and repositories (`@Injectable()` or `@LazySingleton()`).
2. Run `fvm dart run melos run build_runner --no-select` so `lib/di/di.config.dart` updates.
3. Show it from `HomePage` tabs for a quick experiment, or add a `TypedGoRoute` in `lib/routing/routes.dart` when it needs its own path.
4. Resolve the bloc in the page: `get<NameBloc>()..init(...)`.

## Keep out of the module

- A second `GetIt` or manual `registerSingleton` next to injectable
- Chopper clients constructed in widgets
- A new pub package, unless the user asks to split the Melos workspace
